u}_{	au}$ decay. We find no evidence of a signal and set an upper limit on the branching fraction of $\mathcal{B}(B^{-} 	o 	au^{-}  ar{
u}_{	au}) < 4.2 	imes 10^{-4}$ at the 90% confidence level.

